Package: ampheck-eidos-alpha-support
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ampheck <support@amphecktech.com>
Depends: network-manager, modemmanager, usb-modeswitch, wpasupplicant, iw, rfkill, wireless-regdb, systemd-timesyncd, weston, wayland-utils, fonts-dejavu-core, sudo, passwd
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: Ampheck Eidos Alpha board integration
 Installs the AP6256 Wi-Fi firmware, board-specific NetworkManager, ModemManager,
 and SSH configuration, and the Weston DRM/KMS display service. The image
 build creates and configures the default administrator account.
